# A file opened with a mode the caller hands, from the command line: the code does not say which way it goes, so the
# file is in neither domain nor codomain (#76). The handle `open` gives is shown on the screen.

route modeunknown.run
line entry > run call
step run/touch
step run/touch/open                                                  # with open(PATH, mode) as f
line run/touch/open > _·f@run/touch/open value
line run/touch > File(data/notes.txt) own
line run/touch > Screen own                                          # print(f)

home _·f@run/touch/open run/touch

side entry left
side File(data/notes.txt) between
side Screen right
